{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Single source of truth for caption styles. Read by the Python ASS renderer and by the browser preview. Sizes are in pixels at a 1080 px short side and are scaled to the output resolution. Colors are #RRGGBB, opacities 0..1.",
